1
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,960
[There's a saying I really like.]

2
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,280
[If heaven]

3
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,400
[isn't my destination,]

4
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:28,720
[then hell]

5
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:30,160
[will be my paradise.]

6
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,560
[Welcome to my paradise,]

7
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:33,840
[and listen to my story.]

8
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,480
[Now,]

9
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,520
[it's just the beginning.]

10
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,160
Mr Zhou will be here shortly.

11
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:08,920
Coffee or tea?

12
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,160
No, thank you.

13
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,760
Li Sisi.

14
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:40,880
You like this painting very much,

15
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,840
and hang it in a prominent position.

16
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:52,400
The female fencer in the French fencing hall,

17
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,600
Lu Xu's fiancée,

18
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,280
Dark Fairy Tale's

19
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,080
Chief Designer.

20
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,640
What a coincidence!

21
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,240
The painter's name is Ziman,

22
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,160
It depicts her aspirations for the future

23
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,840
and her longing for marriage.

24
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:28,760
So,

25
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,360
it's such a beautiful ring.

26
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,160
Miss Jiang,

27
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,120
this is a company.

28
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,280
You should know that.

29
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,160
We just formally introduced

30
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,160
each other that day.

31
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,400
My name is Jiang Li.

32
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,400
graduated from ESMOD Paris,

33
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:59,320
winner of the French International Clothing Association Fashion Award,

34
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,680
a top luxury clothing designer,

35
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,840
and a student of Charles.

36
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,800
You haven't answered my question yet.

37
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,800
Life

38
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,000
is just a puppet show.

39
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,240
Thread to thread,

40
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,960
the living playing the dead.

41
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,400
The puppeteer, in a careless moment,

42
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:32,000
entangles two puppets together,

43
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,400
and hard to untangle.

44
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:35,600
Isn't that right?

45
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,840
Brother-in-law,

46
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,000
what exactly are you...

47
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,640
I just came by to check in today.

48
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,880
I just moved,

49
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,280
and there's still stuff to unpack at home.

50
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,280
Oh, by the way,

51
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,240
as your subordinate,

52
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,800
I hope to receive

53
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:02,880
your guidance in the future.

54
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,360
Come on, try it.

55
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:20,960
Yuxin,

56
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,400
you haven't changed a bit.

57
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:25,320
We haven't seen each other for years after graduation.

58
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,720
You didn't come see me when back.

59
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,200
Yuxin,

60
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,480
your dark circles

61
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,440
are almost reaching your mouth.

62
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:32,880
Don't mention it.

63
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,960
Since I opened this high-end wedding dress store after returning to China,

64
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,440
I haven't had a full night's sleep.

65
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,360
By the way,

66
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,120
your sister-in-law, Lu Qianqian,

67
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,400
is coming to try on a wedding dress later.

68
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,160
Oh.

69
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,240
I heard she's quite hard to deal with.

70
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,040
Don't underestimate me.

71
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,240
I've dealt with so many socialites.

72
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,120
Dealing with Lu Qianqian

73
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,840
is a piece of cake.

74
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,600
Wait.

75
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,320
Is your engagement to Lu Xu real?

76
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:58,280
Not a PR stunt?

77
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:58,880
Yeah.

78
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,440
You beat your principal in middle school,

79
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,920
got arrested for racing in high school,

80
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,360
barged into a bar drunk in college,

81
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:05,360
and made sexist comments online.

82
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,280
Don't tell me

83
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,400
you don't know any of this.

84
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,280
I know.

85
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,240
Then why...

86
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,280
Lil,

87
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:16,040
I don't know what you're thinking,

88
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,360
but

89
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,080
if the Lu family gives you any trouble,

90
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,440
come to me.

91
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,040
I may not be a rich second generation,

92
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,680
but I'm a first-generation entrepreneur.

93
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,200
Dealing with Lu Xu and Lu Qianqian

94
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,400
is a piece of cake for me.

95
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,600
Yes?

96
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:29,640
Boss.

97
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,120
Yes?

98
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:30,960
The client has arrived,

99
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,120
but there's a problem.

100
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,240
Okay,

101
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:34,000
I'll be right there.

102
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:34,800
Yes?

103
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,160
You two better not meet.

104
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,320
I'll treat you to hot pot when I'm done.

105
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:40,080
Okay.

106
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,400
These two pearls have different luster.

107
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:00,840
And here,

108
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,040
it's so tight

109
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,240
that it's hard to breathe.

110
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:07,280
This outdated design from the last century,

111
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,040
do you call this haute couture?

112
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:10,800
Ms. Lu,

113
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,480
this mermaid dress features innovative cutting,

114
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,520
which can perfectly showcase...

115
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:15,200
Are you kidding me about my wedding?

116
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,680
Do you think

117
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,840
I'm just some small-time boss

118
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,320
or nouveau riche you usually deal with?

119
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,600
I'm sorry, Miss Lu.

120
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,800
I'll immediately replace the designer

121
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:23,800
and remake the dress for you.

122
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,280
This is your last chance.

123
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,880
If you still can't get it right,

124
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,520
this store

125
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,320
might as well close down.

126
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:32,120
[This wedding dress will be beautiful,]

127
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,400
[but you don't believe in fairy tales.]

128
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:37,600
[How could you possibly like]

129
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,960
[a wedding dress for a fairy tale princess?]

130
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,640
Jiang Li.

131
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,160
What are you doing here?

132
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,640
Senior,

133
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,680
bring the white sample dress with 3D pleats.

134
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,320
Oh, okay.

135
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,600
Go, go.

136
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:34,880
Take it off.

137
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,760
I'll remake it for you.

138
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,640
You want to make a wedding dress for me?

139
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,200
Trust me.

140
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,280
You'll like it.

141
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:56,440
This needs to be tightened half an inch.

142
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,000
You seem to know my body well.

143
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,080
Take a deep breath.

144
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,040
When I was studying in Paris,

145
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:11,640
I heard that when making clothes for prisoners on death row,

146
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,360
the collar should leave just enough room

147
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,120
for the rope on the gallows

148
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,160
to struggle.

149
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,560
You're provoking me.

150
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:21,840
Just kidding.

151
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,440
You actually took it seriously.

152
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,760
The wedding dress is a battle garment.

153
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,280
Beauty is a blade.

154
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,400
Your brother-in-law likes to touch here, right?

155
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,680
How did you get this scar?

156
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,960
I got scratched by a thorny vine when I was a child.

157
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,440
Later I found out

158
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,200
that the thorns are more interesting than the flowers.

159
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,080
A wedding dress is not just a candy coating for a princess,

160
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:51,000
but also a bait for hunting.

161
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,000
Look,

162
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:54,600
cracks can also be decorations.

163
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,560
You are really a

164
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,640
mysterious

165
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,600
and interesting weed,

166
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:03,080
which makes me want to get closer.

167
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:04,360
What kind of

168
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,080
variety are you?

169
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:09,320
What if I'm a man-eating plant?

170
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:10,800
You'll be in danger.

171
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:12,360
After all,

172
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,080
I work for Lu Xu.

173
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:15,520
It doesn't matter.

174
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:17,440
What matters is

175
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:20,200
if you can be mine.

176
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,720
Does your face

177
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,280
still hurt?

178
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,440
It's already swollen.

179
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,280
Mr. Zhou, you're so early.

180
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,440
Have you seen the painting?

181
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,080
It's over here.

182
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,080
A new work just arrived.

183
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:55,880
It's from Zimanteng.

184
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,040
Still that style,

185
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,720
a mix of sadness and determination.

186
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,440
But the woman in this painting

187
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,600
looks a bit familiar.

188
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:02,880
She looks a bit like Su Mu.

189
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,400
Still can't meet Zimanteng in person?

190
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:05,840
No way.

191
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,440
Money is not a problem.

192
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,000
Shi'an,

193
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,200
it's not about the money.

194
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,920
The artist herself doesn't want to show up.

195
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,520
I can't break the rules.

196
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:16,920
Wait.

197
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:21,800
Is the artist

198
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:24,800
male or female?

199
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,360
I can't tell you.

200
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:27,320
50,000 yuan.

201
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:28,600
Shi'an,

202
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,040
you're making it hard for me.

203
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,000
100,000 yuan.

204
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:37,640
Female.

205
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,640
After all these years,

206
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,240
this is all you can tell me?

207
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:15,760
Has the painting been delivered?

208
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,560
It's already in the study, sir.

209
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:19,880
Dad.

210
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:20,880
Dad,

211
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:23,120
the girl is playing the cello so well.

212
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,280
She's my aunt,

213
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:26,520
not my sister.

214
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:29,800
Li,

215
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,440
you play the violoncello so well.

216
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,120
Teach me

217
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,560
when you're free.

218
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:43,600
Honey,

219
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,160
you came back so late last night.

220
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:46,320
I haven't introduced her to you.

221
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:47,440
Jiang Li,

222
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,240
my guest for dinner.

223
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,400
You...

224
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,440
We...

225
00:14:59,240 --> 00:14:59,680
Ah...

226
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:02,040
Jiang Li is Jiang Li,

227
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:03,520
Lu Xu is Lu Xu.

228
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:05,920
The problem between me and that jerk

229
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,680
doesn't affect Jiang Li and me

230
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:09,080
to become good sisters.

231
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:11,120
Baby,

232
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,040
let's eat later.

233
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:16,080
Lil,

234
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:17,360
what have you been busy with these days?

235
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,480
You couldn't even come shopping with me yesterday.

236
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:18,960
Come.

237
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,120
I just returned from abroad, so I'm quite busy.

238
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:21,040
Let me hold you while you eat.

239
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:22,800
Then let's hang out when you're free.
